    text: "Fuchs, T. (1929). *Stage lighting*. Little, Brown. https://archive.org/details/fuchs-stage-lighting Locator: title page; p. 4 (PDF p. 9); p. 9 (PDF p. 14); p. 10 (PDF p. 15). Printed page first, PDF page in parentheses.",
